    <title>Bulkstream | Cargo handling</title>
    <style>
        :root{color-scheme:light;--ink:#173335;--teal:#004d4d;--accent:#008080;--paper:#f4f6f6}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Arial,sans-serif}a{color:inherit}header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:25px 7%;background:#fff}.brand{font-size:21px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1px;text-decoration:none}.brand span{color:var(--accent)}nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px;font-size:14px}nav a{text-decoration:none}.button{display:inline-block;background:var(--teal);color:#fff;padding:15px 23px;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;border-radius:4px}.hero{background:var(--teal);color:#fff;padding:95px 7% 80px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:8%;align-items:center}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8de0d2}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,78px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-3px;margin:24px 0}.hero p{color:#c1dad6;line-height:1.7;max-width:550px;font-size:18px}.hero .button{background:#fff;color:var(--teal);margin-top:20px}.diagram{border:1px solid #4c8580;padding:32px;background:#075a59}.diagram-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#b8dcd5;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase}.flow{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin:65px 0}.node{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#cae7e2}.icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:70px;height:70px;border:1px solid #8ac6b9;border-radius:50%;font-size:27px;margin:0 auto 12px}.line{height:1px;background:#77b9ad;flex:1}.diagram small{color:#b8dcd5;line-height:1.5}.section{padding:90px 7%}.intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10%;align-items:start}.label{color:#008080;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:bold;text-transform:uppercase}.section h2{font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,52px);letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1.1;margin:18px 0}.section p{line-height:1.7;color:#536a6a}.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:25px;margin-top:55px}.step{border-top:2px solid #008080;padding-top:22px}.step b{color:#008080;font-size:13px}.step h3{font-size:21px;margin-bottom:10px}.band{background:#e2ecea;padding:55px 7%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:30px}.band h2{font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin:0 0 8px}.band p{margin:0;color:#536a6a}footer{padding:28px 7%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:13px;color:#617777}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #edae49;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:700px){header{padding:20px 6%}nav a:not(.button){display:none}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:65px 6%;gap:45px}.hero h1{letter-spacing:-2px}.intro,.steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section{padding:65px 6%}.steps{gap:20px;margin-top:35px}.band{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;padding:45px 6%}footer{gap:10px;flex-direction:column}.flow{margin:40px 0}.icon{width:56px;height:56px}}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<header><a class="brand" href="/">bulk<span>stream</span><span aria-hidden="true">.</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#workflow">The workflow</a><a href="#commodities">Commodities</a><a class="button" href="{{ url('/admin') }}">Admin login &nbsp; ↗</a></nav></header>
<main>
    <section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">Cargo handling system</div><h1>From vessel to road, with clarity.</h1><p>A single place to follow the journey of bulk liquid cargo through receipt, shore storage and delivery.</p><a class="button" href="{{ url('/admin') }}">Enter the admin panel &nbsp; →</a></div><div class="diagram" aria-label="Cargo journey: vessel, shore tank, truck"><div class="diagram-top"><span>The cargo journey</span><span>01 — 03</span></div><div class="flow"><div class="node"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">⛴</div>VESSEL</div><div class="line"></div><div class="node"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">◫</div>SHORE TANK</div><div class="line"></div><div class="node"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">▰</div>TRUCK</div></div><small>One connected workflow, from discharge to delivery.</small></div></section>
    <section class="section" id="workflow"><div class="intro"><div><div class="label">A clearer flow</div><h2>Every movement has a place in the journey.</h2></div><p>Bulkstream is designed around the practical steps of handling liquid cargo. Follow the flow from the moment a vessel arrives to the point cargo leaves by truck.</p></div><div class="steps"><article class="step"><b>01 / RECEIVE</b><h3>Vessel discharge</h3><p>Record incoming cargo and its journey into shore storage.</p></article><article class="step"><b>02 / STORE</b><h3>Tank storage</h3><p>Keep tank capacity and commodity balances in view.</p></article><article class="step"><b>03 / DELIVER</b><h3>Truck delivery</h3><p>Trace outgoing cargo from the tank to its delivery vehicle.</p></article></div></section>
    <section class="band" id="commodities"><div><div class="label">Built for bulk liquids</div><h2>Three commodities. One clear workflow.</h2><p>Crude palm oil · Crude palm olein · Palm fatty acid distillate</p></div><a class="button" href="{{ url('/admin') }}">Admin login &nbsp; →</a></section>
</main><footer><strong>bulkstream.</strong><span>Cargo handling, from shore to delivery.</span></footer>
</body>
